{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/130","id":4657953786,"node_id":"PR_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABFaK7-g","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/130","diff_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/130.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/130.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/130","number":130,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Apply own MSRP LeaveAll at transmit acceptance","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[A394]\n\nCloses #127\n\nAn own MSRP LeaveAll timer expiry previously moved registrations from IN to LV\nbefore the queued transmission. A valid Listener Leave in that window retained\nthe streaming licence. Keep expiry intent pending until the encoder accepts the\n`sLA` preparation with a reserved transmit slot. That action ages both registrar\narrays and starts both applicant walks; the encoder then collects and emits the\nround.\n\nPeer LeaveAll supersedes an unaccepted own action with type-scoped receive\neffects. Blocked rounds preserve each walk’s completion, drain full tables and\ncoalesce repeated expiries. Empty canceled reservations wait for real content or\na later own action. LV + rLv semantics, #108’s timer behavior and processor\ntop-level ports remain unchanged.\n\nValidation: the phase sweep covers Ready/Ready Failed, sources 0/3/7, both sink\ntypes, exact acceptance edges, peer supersession, reset, mismatched and malformed\ninput, allocation/TX stalls, full tables, renewal and expiry. Both applicant\ntables cover same-edge sLA/join. The original periodic-declaration and six-cycle\nno-storm limits remain unchanged.\n\n## Round 2\n\nThe default SRP suites now cover encoder-busy peer cancellation, a newer expiry\nbehind canceled preparation, peer decode at the join opportunity and retained\nreservation reuse, and sink-plane Talker Leave at -1/0/+1 acceptance clocks.\nThey also pin join-tick coalescing and simultaneous MVRP/preparation arbitration.\nThe canceled empty reservation's shared-slot cost and conditional drain bound\nare documented; the link-up case drains in 649 ms against a 1,200 ms bound.\n\nThe test driver uses explicit reviewed mutation patches, typed/documented\nfunctions and DUT-cycle bounds. C++ declarations follow the parent rule.\nThe current default suites pass 1,987 SRP top checks and 562 encoder checks;\nall 33 donor suites pass 1,015,312 checks. Lint, documentation, matrix, NVM\nfigures and portability gates return 0. All 56 mutation arms are killed,\nincluding every reviewer arm, with seven positive controls and all 49 assertion families covered (64/64 campaign checks).\nThe unchanged parent rule-11, rule-12 and test-evidence gates pass against\n`00b5c6c96af5`; no ratchet was raised.\n\nThe accepted deadline-anchored parent replay returns 0 at that head: a Leave\nin the early expiry window clears ACTIVE throughout the two-second hold.\nThe original LV-anchored helper remains the documented legitimate post-sLA\ncontrol. The original sources, deadline patch, portable runner and recorded\nSHA256 hashes are included in the author packet. The full parent consumer set\nand CRF frame/STREAM_STOP integration remain with the manager.\n","created_at":"2026-09-28T00:48:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T02:16:49Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"38157461665b4effd745630c9e72198744d8f1c9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/130/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/130/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/130/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/statuses/00b5c6c96af5ebcaa92ddb3bdaeb4aa5302ef27c","head":{"label":"Mister-M-alt:127-srp-leaveall-at-transmit","ref":"127-srp-leaveall-at-transmit","sha":"00b5c6c96af5ebcaa92ddb3bdaeb4aa5302ef27c","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/re